{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"nav","type":"text","text":"# BossAI｜主流程图\nA–C 已实现；D–F 尚是计划。类与接口见 [[GGYGO_结构_BossAI.canvas|结构图]]、[[BossAI/结构|结构文档]]。选招 [[GGYGO_流程_Boss选招.canvas|子图]] · 换形态 [[GGYGO_流程_Boss换形态.canvas|目标子图]]。","x":0,"y":0,"width":1800,"height":155,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"spawn","type":"text","text":"1. BossEncounter 由 Definition 创建 BossState、BossCharacter 和 AIController。","x":0,"y":300,"width":410,"height":190,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"bind","type":"text","text":"2. BossState 持有 ASC/属性；PawnExtension 绑定当前 Avatar。","x":490,"y":300,"width":410,"height":180,"color":"5"},
