		{"id":"ga","type":"text","text":"4. BT 申请 GAS 能力；GA 执行 Montage、MeleeTrace、GE 与 Cue。","x":1480,"y":300,"width":420,"height":190,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"future","type":"text","text":"D–F 目标：目标/仇恨、阶段与形态切换事务。\n[[GGYGO_流程_Boss换形态.canvas|换形态目标子图]]","x":980,"y":720,"width":420,"height":190,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"persist","type":"text","text":"换形态时应保留 BossState 的属性、Buff、冷却和 AI 目标；当前完整事务未实现。","x":1480,"y":720,"width":420,"height":190,"color":"3"}
